    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can you still buy a children's cassette player?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, simple ones are still sold, at about £20 to £60. The harder part is the stories: most children's story tapes are second-hand now. If you already own a box of tapes, a cassette player is the sensible choice, because Voxblock doesn't play them. If you are starting from scratch, Voxblock keeps what parents like about a cassette player (the child chooses, presses play, there is no screen and you own the story) and replaces the tapes with solid cardboard audiobooks.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can Voxblock play cassettes?",
            "content": "<p>No. Voxblock plays its own audiobooks, not cassettes or CDs. Each story is stored inside a solid cardboard audiobook that you put on the player, so there is no tape to stretch, tangle or snap.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Voxblock a modern cassette player?",
            "content": "<p>It does the same job in a modern way. A child picks a story, puts it on and presses play, with no screen and no wifi. It is not a cassette player: it plays Voxblock audiobooks only.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What age is it for?",
            "content": "<p>Toddlers to teens. Young children can pick a story by its cover and press play on their own, and the stories run from picture books to unabridged novels for older children.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can my child use it on their own?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. There is no screen or menu. They choose an audiobook by its cover, put it on the player and press play, and the player remembers where the story stopped.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it need wifi or an app?",
            "content": "<p>No wifi is needed. There are no downloads, no streaming and nothing to set up: each story is stored inside its audiobook, so you put it on the player and press play.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does the battery last?",
            "content": "<p>Up to 16 hours, charged by USB-C.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
